B.bLT=new A.d("SOZ-0231","\u0130slam \xc2limleri & M\xfctefekkirler","C\xfcveyn\xee",u.Bj,u._O,"Hud\xfbs ve imk\xe2n delilleri","g\xf6r\xfc\u015f_\xf6zeti","kel\xe2m delilleri","el-\u0130r\u015f\xe2d","C\xfcveyn\xee, Gazz\xe2l\xee'nin hocas\u0131; kel\xe2m ve usulde g\xfc\xe7l\xfc isim. Bu kartta verilen ifade 'Tanr\u0131 ve ilk sebep' ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 alt\u0131nda okunmal\u0131d\u0131r. Ki\u015finin i\xe7inde ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 d\xf6nem ve entelekt\xfcel \xe7evre, bu g\xf6r\xfc\u015f\xfcn etkisini art\u0131rm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r; \xe7\xfcnk\xfc s\xf6z sadece ki\u015fisel bir inan\xe7 beyan\u0131 de\u011fil, kendi alan\u0131ndaki bir birikimin sonucudur. Bu s\xf6z/g\xf6r\xfc\u015f, varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n kendi kendine a\xe7\u0131klan\u0131p a\xe7\u0131klanamayaca\u011f\u0131 sorusuna ba\u011flan\u0131r. \u0130nsan akl\u0131 sebep arar; bu aray\u0131\u015f sonsuza ertelendi\u011finde a\xe7\u0131klama eksik kal\u0131r. Bu nedenle s\xf6z, nihai temel, ilk sebep veya zorunlu varl\u0131k d\xfc\u015f\xfcncesine pencere a\xe7ar. Uygulamada bu kart, felsefi deliller b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcne \xe7apraz ba\u011flanabilir. Bu kart uygulamada 'S\xf6zler' b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde tek ba\u015f\u0131na okunabilir; ayr\u0131ca deliller, mucizeler veya cevaplar b\xf6l\xfcmlerine ba\u011flant\u0131 verebilir. Do\u011frudan al\u0131nt\u0131 olmayan maddeler \xf6zellikle 'g\xf6r\xfc\u015f \xf6zeti' diye i\u015faretlendi; Claude Code aray\xfcz\xfcnde bunlar\u0131 'S\xf6z\xfcn \xf6z\xfc' etiketiyle g\xf6stermek daha g\xfcvenlidir.",u.Og,B.aLk)
