B.bHZ=new A.d("SOZ-0542",u.L,"Aliya \u0130zzetbegovi\xe7","Bosna lideri ve d\xfc\u015f\xfcn\xfcr.",u.e3,"\u0130slam'\u0131n insan\u0131 b\xfct\xfcnc\xfcl a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131","g\xf6r\xfc\u015f_\xf6zeti","medeniyet","Islam Between East and West","Aliya \u0130zzetbegovi\xe7, Bosna lideri ve d\xfc\u015f\xfcn\xfcr. Bu kartta verilen ifade 'Evrenin d\xfczeni' ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 alt\u0131nda okunmal\u0131d\u0131r. Ki\u015finin i\xe7inde ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 d\xf6nem ve entelekt\xfcel \xe7evre, bu g\xf6r\xfc\u015f\xfcn etkisini art\u0131rm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r; \xe7\xfcnk\xfc s\xf6z sadece ki\u015fisel bir inan\xe7 beyan\u0131 de\u011fil, kendi alan\u0131ndaki bir birikimin sonucudur. Bu g\xf6r\xfc\u015f, k\xe2inat\u0131n rastgele bir y\u0131\u011f\u0131n de\u011fil, d\xfczenli ve okunabilir bir yap\u0131 gibi g\xf6r\xfcnmesine dikkat \xe7eker. Matematik, yasa, \xf6l\xe7\xfc ve s\xfcreklilik fikri burada \xf6ne \xe7\u0131kar. Tarihte bir\xe7ok bilim insan\u0131, do\u011fadaki d\xfczeni sadece teknik bir veri de\u011fil, derin bir hayret sebebi olarak g\xf6rm\xfc\u015ft\xfcr. Bu nedenle kart, d\xfczen ve tasar\u0131m delilleriyle ba\u011flant\u0131l\u0131d\u0131r. Bu kart uygulamada 'S\xf6zler' b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde tek ba\u015f\u0131na okunabilir; ayr\u0131ca deliller, mucizeler veya cevaplar b\xf6l\xfcmlerine ba\u011flant\u0131 verebilir. Do\u011frudan al\u0131nt\u0131 olmayan maddeler \xf6zellikle 'g\xf6r\xfc\u015f \xf6zeti' diye i\u015faretlendi; Claude Code aray\xfcz\xfcnde bunlar\u0131 'S\xf6z\xfcn \xf6z\xfc' etiketiyle g\xf6stermek daha g\xfcvenlidir.",u.tF,B.b5Q)
