B.bNc=new A.d("SOZ-0814",u.X,"William James",u.eL,u.F1,u.lG,"g\xf6r\xfc\u015f_\xf6zeti","din\xee tecr\xfcbe","The Varieties of Religious Experience","William James, Psikolog ve filozof; din\xee tecr\xfcbeyi akademik incelemeye ta\u015f\u0131d\u0131. Bu kartta verilen ifade 'Ahlak ve vicdan' ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 alt\u0131nda okunmal\u0131d\u0131r. Ki\u015finin i\xe7inde ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 d\xf6nem ve entelekt\xfcel \xe7evre, bu g\xf6r\xfc\u015f\xfcn etkisini art\u0131rm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r; \xe7\xfcnk\xfc s\xf6z sadece ki\u015fisel bir inan\xe7 beyan\u0131 de\u011fil, kendi alan\u0131ndaki bir birikimin sonucudur. Bu g\xf6r\xfc\u015f, iyi ve k\xf6t\xfcn\xfcn yaln\u0131zca ki\u015fisel zevk veya toplumsal al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131k olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131 sorusunu a\xe7ar. Vicdan\u0131n bask\u0131s\u0131, adalet arzusu ve su\xe7luluk duygusu bir\xe7ok d\xfc\u015f\xfcn\xfcrde a\u015fk\u0131n bir ahlak kayna\u011f\u0131na i\u015faret eder. Tarih boyunca zulme kar\u015f\u0131 \xe7\u0131kan liderler \xe7o\u011fu zaman bu a\u015fk\u0131n dili kullanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. Kart, ahlak delili ve insan onuru ba\u015fl\u0131klar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r. Bu kart uygulamada 'S\xf6zler' b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcnde tek ba\u015f\u0131na okunabilir; ayr\u0131ca deliller, mucizeler veya cevaplar b\xf6l\xfcmlerine ba\u011flant\u0131 verebilir. Do\u011frudan al\u0131nt\u0131 olmayan maddeler \xf6zellikle 'g\xf6r\xfc\u015f \xf6zeti' diye i\u015faretlendi; Claude Code aray\xfcz\xfcnde bunlar\u0131 'S\xf6z\xfcn \xf6z\xfc' etiketiyle g\xf6stermek daha g\xfcvenlidir.",u.ng,B.b1v)
