B.arj=new A.e("\u0130htira ve Hudus delili a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131; Risale-i Nur'da Allah'\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 bahisleri derlemesi","Kaynak zemini: Kel\xe2m gelene\u011finde hud\xfbs ve ihtir\xe2 delilleri, sonradan olan ve kendi kendine var olamayan \u015feylerin yarat\u0131c\u0131ya muhta\xe7 oldu\u011funu savunur.","Bu kart, Risale-i Nur tarz\u0131 tefekk\xfcrde k\xe2inat\u0131n bir kitap, varl\u0131klar\u0131n ise Allah\u2019\u0131n isimlerine ayna olarak okunmas\u0131na dayan\u0131r. \u015euursuz sebeplerin hikmetli, \xf6l\xe7\xfcl\xfc ve faydal\u0131 sonu\xe7lar do\u011furmas\u0131, onlar\u0131 a\u015fan bir ilim ve iradeye i\u015faret eder. Tek bir k\xfc\xe7\xfck varl\u0131k bile g\xfcne\u015f, hava, toprak, su ve kozmik d\xfczenle ba\u011flant\u0131l\u0131d\u0131r. Bu ba\u011flant\u0131, par\xe7ay\u0131 yapan\u0131n b\xfct\xfcne h\xfckmeden tek Yarat\u0131c\u0131 olmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fi fikrini g\xfc\xe7lendirir. Bu nedenle \u201c\u0130htira Delili\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Yoktan var edilme, varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n sahibini g\xf6sterir. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.a8L=new A.b("DELIL-0017","Felsefi ve Kel\xe2m\xee Deliller","Klasik arg\xfcmanlar","\u0130htira Delili","Yoktan var edilme, varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n sahibini g\xf6sterir.","\u0130htira, varl\u0131klar\u0131n b\xfct\xfcn y\xf6nleriyle yarat\u0131lm\u0131\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ifade eder. Her varl\u0131k, varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 kendinden olmayan bir sanat eseri gibi d\xfc\u015f\xfcn\xfcld\xfc\u011f\xfcnde yarat\u0131c\u0131ya i\u015faret eder.",B.b0G,"orta-y\xfcksek",B.aJA,B.arj)
