B.apt=new A.e(u.e5,u.B,"Bu delil, g\xf6r\xfcnen olgunun yaln\u0131z y\xfczeysel a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131yla yetinmeyip onun nihai anlam\u0131n\u0131 ve temelini sorar. Karttaki veri, tek ba\u015f\u0131na matematiksel bir zorunlu ispat gibi de\u011fil; Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 daha makul k\u0131lan bir i\u015faret olarak okunmal\u0131d\u0131r. Farkl\u0131 deliller bir araya geldi\u011finde k\xfcm\xfclatif bir tablo olu\u015fturur: evren, hayat, ak\u0131l, ahlak ve f\u0131trat ayn\u0131 y\xf6ne bakmaya ba\u015flar. Teist yorumda bu b\xfct\xfcnl\xfck, varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n arkas\u0131nda ilim, irade, kudret ve hikmet sahibi Allah\u2019\u0131n bulundu\u011funu g\xf6sterir. Bu nedenle \u201cHakikat Sevgisi\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: \u0130nsan menfaatine ayk\u0131r\u0131 olsa da ger\xe7e\u011fi bilmek ister. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
