B.awq=new A.e(u._,u.EY,"Bu delil, felsefe, dinler tarihi veya d\xfc\u015f\xfcnce tarihi i\xe7inde tekrar tekrar ortaya \xe7\u0131kan Tanr\u0131 aray\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 dikkate al\u0131r. Farkl\u0131 k\xfclt\xfcrlerde benzer nihai a\xe7\u0131klama, ilk ilke, mutlak iyi veya kutsal fikrinin do\u011fmas\u0131 basit bir tesad\xfcf gibi g\xf6r\xfcnmeyebilir. \u0130nsanl\u0131k tarihindeki bu s\xfcreklilik, akl\u0131n ve f\u0131trat\u0131n ortak bir y\xf6ne i\u015faret etti\u011fini d\xfc\u015f\xfcnd\xfcr\xfcr. Teist yorum, bu ortak y\xf6neli\u015fi insan\u0131n yarat\u0131l\u0131\u015ftan gelen hakikat aray\u0131\u015f\u0131yla a\xe7\u0131klar. Bu nedenle \u201cGazz\xe2l\xee\u2019nin Hud\xfbs Savunusu\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: \xc2lemin ezel\xeeli\u011fi yerine yarat\u0131lm\u0131\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 savunulur. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
