B.ay6=new A.e("Kurt G\xf6del \u2013 Ontological Proof; Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy \u2013 Ontological Arguments; Alvin Plantinga \u2013 modal ontolojik arg\xfcman ve teistik epistemoloji",u.jv,"Bu kart\u0131n \xe7ekirde\u011fi, soyut ve zorunlu matematiksel d\xfczenin fiziksel evrenle \u015fa\u015f\u0131rt\u0131c\u0131 bi\xe7imde \xf6rt\xfc\u015fmesidir. Matematik insan zihninde kurulan bir sembol oyunu gibi g\xf6r\xfcnse de do\u011fan\u0131n derin yap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 \xf6l\xe7er, tahmin eder ve teknolojiye d\xf6n\xfc\u015ft\xfcr\xfcr. Bu uyum, evrenin ak\u0131ls\u0131z kaos de\u011fil akla a\xe7\u0131k bir d\xfczen ta\u015f\u0131d\u0131\u011f\u0131 fikrini g\xfc\xe7lendirir. Teist yorumda bu akledilebilirlik, evrenin arkas\u0131nda ilim ve hikmet sahibi bir Yarat\u0131c\u0131 bulundu\u011funa i\u015faret eder. Bu nedenle \u201cG\xf6del\u2019in Ontolojik Kan\u0131t\u0131\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Matematiksel mant\u0131kla Tanr\u0131\u2019n\u0131n zorunlu varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 form\xfcle edilebilir. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.ahb=new A.b("DELIL-0219","Matematiksel ve Mant\u0131ksal Deliller","Soyut Ger\xe7ekler","G\xf6del\u2019in Ontolojik Kan\u0131t\u0131","Matematiksel mant\u0131kla Tanr\u0131\u2019n\u0131n zorunlu varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 form\xfcle edilebilir.","\xdcnl\xfc matematik\xe7i Kurt G\xf6del, modal mant\u0131k kullanarak ontolojik arg\xfcman\u0131 formalize etti. Pozitif \xf6zelliklerin tamam\u0131na sahip bir varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n m\xfcmk\xfcn olmas\u0131 durumunda, o varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n t\xfcm m\xfcmk\xfcn d\xfcnyalarda var olmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini g\xf6sterdi. Bu delil, felsefe tarihinin en teknik ve soyut delillerinden biridir ve Tanr\u0131 kavram\u0131n\u0131n mant\u0131ksal tutarl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\xfc\xe7l\xfc bi\xe7imde savunur.",B.b_O,"orta",B.aRJ,B.ay6)
