B.ay7=new A.e("Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy: Fine-Tuning; Martin Rees \u2013 Just Six Numbers",u.E,"Bu kart, fiziksel evrenin yaln\u0131zca var olmas\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fil, \xf6l\xe7\xfclebilir ve ya\u015fam\u0131 m\xfcmk\xfcn k\u0131lan bir d\xfczen i\xe7inde var olmas\u0131n\u0131 merkeze al\u0131r. Sabitler, kuvvetler, ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 ko\u015fullar\u0131 ve enerji dengeleri k\xfc\xe7\xfck de\u011fi\u015fimlere duyarl\u0131 oldu\u011funda, \u201cneden b\xf6yle?\u201d sorusu g\xfc\xe7lenir. Do\u011fal a\xe7\u0131klamalar bu mekanizmalar\u0131 tasvir edebilir; fakat d\xfczenin nihai zemini ayr\u0131 bir felsefi sorudur. Teist yorum, bu uygunlu\u011fu ilim, kudret ve hikmet sahibi bir yarat\u0131\u015f\u0131n izi olarak okur. Bu nedenle \u201cKozmolojik Sabitin Hassas Ayar\u0131\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Kozmolojik sabit 10^120 derecede hassas ayarlanm\u0131\u015f durumda. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.adp=new A.b("DELIL-0222","Fizik ve Kozmoloji Delilleri","\u0130nce Ayar","Kozmolojik Sabitin Hassas Ayar\u0131","Kozmolojik sabit 10^120 derecede hassas ayarlanm\u0131\u015f durumda.","Kozmolojik sabit, evrenin geni\u015fleme h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 belirleyen en kritik de\u011ferlerden biridir. G\xf6zlenen de\u011feri teorik beklentiye g\xf6re 10^120 oran\u0131nda hassast\u0131r. Bu de\u011fer birazc\u0131k bile farkl\u0131 olsayd\u0131 evren ya hemen \xe7\xf6ker ya da y\u0131ld\u0131zlar ve galaksiler asla olu\u015fmazd\u0131. Bu ola\u011fan\xfcst\xfc hassasiyet, evrenin ya\u015fam i\xe7in \xf6zel olarak tasarland\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\xfc\xe7l\xfc bi\xe7imde i\u015faret eder.",B.b8C,"y\xfcksek",B.b9m,B.ay7)
B.aQT=s(["strong-force","fine-tuning"],t.s)
B.ayG=new A.e(u.X3,u.E,"Bu kart, fiziksel evrenin yaln\u0131zca var olmas\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fil, \xf6l\xe7\xfclebilir ve ya\u015fam\u0131 m\xfcmk\xfcn k\u0131lan bir d\xfczen i\xe7inde var olmas\u0131n\u0131 merkeze al\u0131r. Sabitler, kuvvetler, ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 ko\u015fullar\u0131 ve enerji dengeleri k\xfc\xe7\xfck de\u011fi\u015fimlere duyarl\u0131 oldu\u011funda, \u201cneden b\xf6yle?\u201d sorusu g\xfc\xe7lenir. Do\u011fal a\xe7\u0131klamalar bu mekanizmalar\u0131 tasvir edebilir; fakat d\xfczenin nihai zemini ayr\u0131 bir felsefi sorudur. Teist yorum, bu uygunlu\u011fu ilim, kudret ve hikmet sahibi bir yarat\u0131\u015f\u0131n izi olarak okur. Bu nedenle \u201cG\xfc\xe7l\xfc N\xfckleer Kuvvetin Hassas Dengesi\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: G\xfc\xe7l\xfc kuvvet %2 oran\u0131nda de\u011fi\u015fse atomlar olu\u015fmazd\u0131. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.aeX=new A.b("DELIL-0223","Fizik ve Kozmoloji Delilleri","\u0130nce Ayar","G\xfc\xe7l\xfc N\xfckleer Kuvvetin Hassas Dengesi","G\xfc\xe7l\xfc kuvvet %2 oran\u0131nda de\u011fi\u015fse atomlar olu\u015fmazd\u0131.","G\xfc\xe7l\xfc n\xfckleer kuvvet atom \xe7ekirde\u011fini bir arada tutar. Bu kuvvet sadece %2 daha g\xfc\xe7l\xfc veya %2 daha zay\u0131f olsayd\u0131 hidrojen d\u0131\u015f\u0131ndaki elementler olu\u015fmaz veya evren kararl\u0131 atomlara sahip olamazd\u0131. Ya\u015fam\u0131n kimyasal temeli bu hassas dengeye ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r. B\xf6yle ince bir ayar tesad\xfcfle a\xe7\u0131klanmas\u0131 zor bir durumdur.",B.aQT,"orta-y\xfcksek",B.bJ,B.ayG)
B.b0Q=s(["bilin\xe7","chalmers","qualia"],t.s)
B.b5x=s(["CHALMERS-1995","TASLAMAN-12"],t.s)
B.aAf=new A.e("David Chalmers, Facing Up to the Problem of Consciousness, Journal of Consciousness Studies, 1995; Caner Taslaman: Allah'\u0131n Varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131n 12 Delili",u.H,"Bu delil, insan\u0131n yaln\u0131zca fiziksel par\xe7ac\u0131klardan ibaret g\xf6r\xfcnmeyen \xf6znel tecr\xfcbesine odaklan\u0131r. Ac\u0131 hissetmek, renk g\xf6rmek, benlik ya\u015famak ve hakikat aramak \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc \u015fah\u0131s \xf6l\xe7\xfcmlerine tam olarak indirgenmekte zorlan\u0131r. Bilincin varl\u0131\u011f\u0131, evrende yaln\u0131z madde de\u011fil anlam, \xf6zne ve i\xe7 tecr\xfcbe bulundu\u011funu g\xf6sterir. Teist yorumda bilin\xe7, ilim ve irade sahibi Allah\u2019\u0131n insanda yaratt\u0131\u011f\u0131 \xf6zel bir ayna olarak anla\u015f\u0131l\u0131r. Bu nedenle \u201cBilin\xe7in Zor Problemi\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Fiziksel beyinden \xf6znel deneyim nas\u0131l ortaya \xe7\u0131k\u0131yor? Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.ajo=new A.b("DELIL-0224","Zihin ve Bilin\xe7 Delilleri","Bilin\xe7 Problemi","Bilin\xe7in Zor Problemi","Fiziksel beyinden \xf6znel deneyim nas\u0131l ortaya \xe7\u0131k\u0131yor?","David Chalmers\u2019\u0131n \u2018Zor Problem\u2019 diye adland\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131 olgu, beyindeki n\xf6ronal faaliyetlerin neden \xf6znel deneyim (renk g\xf6rmek, ac\u0131 hissetmek, ben olmak) \xfcretti\u011fini a\xe7\u0131klaman\u0131n zorlu\u011fudur. Fiziksel s\xfcre\xe7ler \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc \u015fah\u0131s nesnel veriler \xfcretir ama birinci \u015fah\u0131s nitel deneyim a\xe7\u0131klanamaz. Bu k\xf6pr\xfc, bilin\xe7in maddi evrenden daha temel bir kayna\u011fa i\u015faret etti\u011fini d\xfc\u015f\xfcnd\xfcr\xfcr.",B.b0Q,"orta-y\xfcksek",B.b5x,B.aAf)
B.aM5=s(["aquinas","bes-yol"],t.s)
B.b5I=s(["AQUINAS-SUMMA","SEP-KOZMOLOJIK"],t.s)
B.aB3=new A.e("Thomas Aquinas, Summa Theologiae, Five Ways; Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy: Cosmological Argument",u.Ht,"Bu delil, felsefe, dinler tarihi veya d\xfc\u015f\xfcnce tarihi i\xe7inde tekrar tekrar ortaya \xe7\u0131kan Tanr\u0131 aray\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 dikkate al\u0131r. Farkl\u0131 k\xfclt\xfcrlerde benzer nihai a\xe7\u0131klama, ilk ilke, mutlak iyi veya kutsal fikrinin do\u011fmas\u0131 basit bir tesad\xfcf gibi g\xf6r\xfcnmeyebilir. \u0130nsanl\u0131k tarihindeki bu s\xfcreklilik, akl\u0131n ve f\u0131trat\u0131n ortak bir y\xf6ne i\u015faret etti\u011fini d\xfc\u015f\xfcnd\xfcr\xfcr. Teist yorum, bu ortak y\xf6neli\u015fi insan\u0131n yarat\u0131l\u0131\u015ftan gelen hakikat aray\u0131\u015f\u0131yla a\xe7\u0131klar. Bu nedenle \u201cAquinas\u2019\u0131n Be\u015f Yolu\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Thomas Aquinas\u2019\u0131n do\u011fadan hareketle be\u015f delili. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.aes=new A.b("DELIL-0225","Tarih\xee Deliller","Klasik Arg\xfcmanlar","Aquinas\u2019\u0131n Be\u015f Yolu","Thomas Aquinas\u2019\u0131n do\u011fadan hareketle be\u015f delili.","Thomas Aquinas Summa Theologica\u2019da be\u015f yol ile Tanr\u0131\u2019n\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 savundu: Hareket ettirici, ilk sebep, zorunlu varl\u0131k, dereceleme ve gaye. Bu arg\xfcmanlar binlerce y\u0131ld\u0131r tart\u0131\u015f\u0131lm\u0131\u015f ve h\xe2l\xe2 felsefi g\xfcc\xfcn\xfc korumaktad\u0131r. Do\u011fadaki d\xfczen, nedensellik ve ama\xe7l\u0131l\u0131ktan yola \xe7\u0131karak nihai bir a\xe7\u0131klay\u0131c\u0131ya ula\u015f\u0131r.",B.aM5,"orta-y\xfcksek",B.b5I,B.aB3)
B.b2t=s(["lewis","arzu"],t.s)
B.aYB=s(["LEWIS-MERE","ROUTLEDGE"],t.s)
B.ati=new A.e("C. S. Lewis, Mere Christianity and argument from desire/reason tradition; Routledge Encyclopedia of Philosophy: God, Arguments for the Existence of",u.zw,"Bu delil, g\xfczellik tecr\xfcbesinin yaln\u0131z biyolojik fayda hesab\u0131yla a\xe7\u0131klanmakta zorlanan y\xf6n\xfcn\xfc \xf6ne \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r. \u0130nsan simetri, m\xfczik, renk, \u015fiir ve tabiat kar\u015f\u0131s\u0131nda derin bir hayranl\u0131k hisseder. G\xfczellik, evrenin yaln\u0131z \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r de\u011fil, ayn\u0131 zamanda anlaml\u0131 ve seyredilmeye de\u011fer oldu\u011funu g\xf6sterir. Teist yorumda g\xfczellik, Cem\xeel olan Allah\u2019\u0131n isim ve sanat\u0131n\u0131n varl\u0131ktaki yans\u0131mas\u0131d\u0131r. Bu nedenle \u201cC.S. Lewis\u2019in Arzu Arg\xfcman\u0131\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Hi\xe7bir d\xfcnyevi \u015feyin doyuramad\u0131\u011f\u0131 sonsuzluk arzusu. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.afX=new A.b("DELIL-0226","Estetik ve Anlam Delilleri","G\xfczellik ve A\u015fk","C.S. Lewis\u2019in Arzu Arg\xfcman\u0131","Hi\xe7bir d\xfcnyevi \u015feyin doyuramad\u0131\u011f\u0131 sonsuzluk arzusu.","C.S. Lewis, insan\u0131n i\xe7indeki derin mutluluk ve anlam arzusunun hi\xe7bir maddi \u015feyle tam olarak doyurulmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 savunur. Bu arzu, ger\xe7ek bir nesneye (Tanr\u0131\u2019ya) i\u015faret eder. E\u011fer bu arzu bo\u015f bir yan\u0131lsama olsayd\u0131, do\u011fan\u0131n di\u011fer arzular gibi (a\xe7l\u0131k-yemek) bir kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 olmas\u0131 beklenirdi. Bu delil, insan\u0131n manevi boyutunu g\xfc\xe7l\xfc bi\xe7imde vurgular.",B.b2t,"orta-y\xfcksek",B.aYB,B.ati)
B.b4P=s(["protein","katlanma"],t.s)
