B.aMR=s(["PLANTINGA-EAAN"],t.s)
B.aBZ=new A.e("Alvin Plantinga \u2013 Evolutionary Argument Against Naturalism","Kaynak zemini: Plantinga\u2019n\u0131n evrimsel arg\xfcman\u0131, yaln\u0131z k\xf6r evrim ve nat\xfcralizm kabul edilirse bili\u015fsel yetilerimize g\xfcvenin nas\u0131l temellenece\u011fini sorgular.","Bu delil, insan\u0131n yaln\u0131zca fiziksel par\xe7ac\u0131klardan ibaret g\xf6r\xfcnmeyen \xf6znel tecr\xfcbesine odaklan\u0131r. Ac\u0131 hissetmek, renk g\xf6rmek, benlik ya\u015famak ve hakikat aramak \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc \u015fah\u0131s \xf6l\xe7\xfcmlerine tam olarak indirgenmekte zorlan\u0131r. Bilincin varl\u0131\u011f\u0131, evrende yaln\u0131z madde de\u011fil anlam, \xf6zne ve i\xe7 tecr\xfcbe bulundu\u011funu g\xf6sterir. Teist yorumda bilin\xe7, ilim ve irade sahibi Allah\u2019\u0131n insanda yaratt\u0131\u011f\u0131 \xf6zel bir ayna olarak anla\u015f\u0131l\u0131r. Bu nedenle \u201cPlantinga\u2019n\u0131n Evrimsel Arg\xfcman\u0131\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Do\u011fal se\xe7ilim do\u011fru inan\xe7 de\u011fil hayatta kalmay\u0131 se\xe7er. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.ajF=new A.b("DELIL-0229","Zihin ve Bilin\xe7 Delilleri","Bilin\xe7 Problemi","Plantinga\u2019n\u0131n Evrimsel Arg\xfcman\u0131","Do\u011fal se\xe7ilim do\u011fru inan\xe7 de\u011fil hayatta kalmay\u0131 se\xe7er.","Alvin Plantinga, evrimsel s\xfcrecin g\xfcvenilir do\u011fru inan\xe7lar \xfcretme kapasitesini garanti etmedi\u011fini savunur. E\u011fer zihnimiz sadece hayatta kalmak i\xe7in \u015fekillendiyse, inan\xe7lar\u0131m\u0131z\u0131n do\u011fru olma ihtimali \xe7ok d\xfc\u015f\xfckt\xfcr. Bu arg\xfcman, materyalist evrim g\xf6r\xfc\u015f\xfcn\xfcn kendi kendini \xe7\xfcr\xfctt\xfc\u011f\xfcn\xfc g\xf6sterir.",B.b4L,"orta",B.aMR,B.aBZ)
B.aZG=s(["estetik","guzellik"],t.s)
B.aV8=s(["KREEFT-20","ROUTLEDGE"],t.s)
B.aur=new A.e("Peter Kreeft, Twenty Arguments for the Existence of God / Handbook of Christian Apologetics; Routledge Encyclopedia of Philosophy: God, Arguments for the Existence of",u.tB,"Bu delil, g\xfczellik tecr\xfcbesinin yaln\u0131z biyolojik fayda hesab\u0131yla a\xe7\u0131klanmakta zorlanan y\xf6n\xfcn\xfc \xf6ne \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r. \u0130nsan simetri, m\xfczik, renk, \u015fiir ve tabiat kar\u015f\u0131s\u0131nda derin bir hayranl\u0131k hisseder. G\xfczellik, evrenin yaln\u0131z \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r de\u011fil, ayn\u0131 zamanda anlaml\u0131 ve seyredilmeye de\u011fer oldu\u011funu g\xf6sterir. Teist yorumda g\xfczellik, Cem\xeel olan Allah\u2019\u0131n isim ve sanat\u0131n\u0131n varl\u0131ktaki yans\u0131mas\u0131d\u0131r. Bu nedenle \u201cG\xfczellik Delili\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Evrenin g\xfczelli\u011fi hayatta kalma amac\u0131n\u0131 a\u015far. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.a8l=new A.b("DELIL-0230","Estetik ve Anlam Delilleri","G\xfczellik","G\xfczellik Delili","Evrenin g\xfczelli\u011fi hayatta kalma amac\u0131n\u0131 a\u015far.","G\xfcn bat\u0131m\u0131, simetri, m\xfczik ve do\u011fadaki estetik d\xfczen sadece hayatta kalma arac\u0131 de\u011fildir. \u0130nsan bu g\xfczellik kar\u015f\u0131s\u0131nda derin bir hayranl\u0131k ve haz duyar. Bu estetik deneyim, evrenin yaln\u0131zca fonksiyonel de\u011fil, ayn\u0131 zamanda g\xfczel ve anlaml\u0131 yarat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 d\xfc\u015f\xfcnd\xfcr\xfcr.",B.aZG,"orta",B.aV8,B.aur)
B.aIu=s(["flatness","fine-tuning"],t.s)
B.azg=new A.e(u.X3,u.E,"Bu kart, fiziksel evrenin yaln\u0131zca var olmas\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fil, \xf6l\xe7\xfclebilir ve ya\u015fam\u0131 m\xfcmk\xfcn k\u0131lan bir d\xfczen i\xe7inde var olmas\u0131n\u0131 merkeze al\u0131r. Sabitler, kuvvetler, ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 ko\u015fullar\u0131 ve enerji dengeleri k\xfc\xe7\xfck de\u011fi\u015fimlere duyarl\u0131 oldu\u011funda, \u201cneden b\xf6yle?\u201d sorusu g\xfc\xe7lenir. Do\u011fal a\xe7\u0131klamalar bu mekanizmalar\u0131 tasvir edebilir; fakat d\xfczenin nihai zemini ayr\u0131 bir felsefi sorudur. Teist yorum, bu uygunlu\u011fu ilim, kudret ve hikmet sahibi bir yarat\u0131\u015f\u0131n izi olarak okur. Bu nedenle \u201cEvrenin D\xfczl\xfc\u011f\xfc (Flatness Problem)\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Evren inan\u0131lmaz derecede d\xfcz g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyor. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.ab3=new A.b("DELIL-0231","Fizik ve Kozmoloji Delilleri","\u0130nce Ayar","Evrenin D\xfczl\xfc\u011f\xfc (Flatness Problem)","Evren inan\u0131lmaz derecede d\xfcz g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyor.","Evrenin uzay-geometrisi neredeyse m\xfckemmel d\xfczd\xfcr. Bu d\xfczl\xfck, B\xfcy\xfck Patlama\u2019dan hemen sonra inan\u0131lmaz hassas bir ayar\u0131 gerektirir. En ufak sapma evrenin ya hemen \xe7\xf6kmesine ya da da\u011f\u0131lmas\u0131na yol a\xe7ard\u0131. Bu hassasiyet, evrenin tesad\xfcfi de\u011fil, ince ayarlanm\u0131\u015f bir yap\u0131 oldu\u011funu g\xf6sterir.",B.aIu,"orta-y\xfcksek",B.bJ,B.azg)
B.aRI=s(["molecular-machines","h\xfccre"],t.s)
B.apV=new A.e(u.VR,u.vu,"Bu kart, canl\u0131 sistemlerdeki bilgi, i\u015flev, koordinasyon ve ama\xe7l\u0131 g\xf6r\xfcnen d\xfczeni merkeze al\u0131r. Biyoloji s\xfcre\xe7leri a\xe7\u0131klasa da, bilgi ta\u015f\u0131yan ve \xe7ok par\xe7al\u0131 i\u015flevsel sistemlerin ortaya \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 h\xe2l\xe2 g\xfc\xe7l\xfc felsefi sorular do\u011furur. Canl\u0131l\u0131kta par\xe7alar yaln\u0131z yan yana durmaz; b\xfct\xfcn\xfcn devam\u0131 i\xe7in g\xf6revli ve zamana ba\u011fl\u0131 \u015fekilde i\u015fler. Teist yorum, bu i\u015flevsel b\xfct\xfcnl\xfc\u011f\xfc k\xf6r tesad\xfcften ziyade ilim ve hikmetle kurulan hayat d\xfczeni olarak yorumlar. Bu nedenle \u201cH\xfccre \u0130\xe7i Molek\xfcler Makineler\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: H\xfccrede nano \xf6l\xe7ekte ileri teknoloji makineler \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.a7t=new A.b("DELIL-0232","Biyolojik Deliller","Molek\xfcler Karma\u015f\u0131kl\u0131k","H\xfccre \u0130\xe7i Molek\xfcler Makineler","H\xfccrede nano \xf6l\xe7ekte ileri teknoloji makineler \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.","H\xfccre i\xe7inde ribozomlar, proteazomlar, motor proteinler ve ATP sentaz gibi nano makineler son derece karma\u015f\u0131k ve verimli \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. Bu makinelerin her biri ayr\u0131 bir m\xfchendislik harikas\u0131d\u0131r. B\xf6yle bir sistemin k\xf6r tesad\xfcf ve do\u011fal se\xe7ilimle ad\u0131m ad\u0131m ortaya \xe7\u0131kmas\u0131 olas\u0131l\u0131k a\xe7\u0131s\u0131ndan ola\u011fan\xfcst\xfc zordur.",B.aRI,"orta",B.zx,B.apV)
B.aSp=s(["leibniz","yeter-sebep"],t.s)
B.aVT=s(["LEIBNIZ","SEP-KOZMOLOJIK"],t.s)
B.aBW=new A.e("G. W. Leibniz, Principle of Sufficient Reason and cosmological reasoning; Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy: Cosmological Argument",u.I,"Bu delil, felsefe, dinler tarihi veya d\xfc\u015f\xfcnce tarihi i\xe7inde tekrar tekrar ortaya \xe7\u0131kan Tanr\u0131 aray\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 dikkate al\u0131r. Farkl\u0131 k\xfclt\xfcrlerde benzer nihai a\xe7\u0131klama, ilk ilke, mutlak iyi veya kutsal fikrinin do\u011fmas\u0131 basit bir tesad\xfcf gibi g\xf6r\xfcnmeyebilir. \u0130nsanl\u0131k tarihindeki bu s\xfcreklilik, akl\u0131n ve f\u0131trat\u0131n ortak bir y\xf6ne i\u015faret etti\u011fini d\xfc\u015f\xfcnd\xfcr\xfcr. Teist yorum, bu ortak y\xf6neli\u015fi insan\u0131n yarat\u0131l\u0131\u015ftan gelen hakikat aray\u0131\u015f\u0131yla a\xe7\u0131klar. Bu nedenle \u201cLeibniz\u2019in Yeter Sebep \u0130lkesi\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Ni\xe7in hi\xe7bir \u015fey de\u011fil de bir \u015feyler var? Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.aak=new A.b("DELIL-0233","Tarih\xee Deliller","Klasik Arg\xfcmanlar","Leibniz\u2019in Yeter Sebep \u0130lkesi",u.wP,"Gottfried Wilhelm Leibniz, her \u015feyin yeterli bir sebebi olmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini savunur. Evrenin var olmas\u0131 da bir a\xe7\u0131klama gerektirir. Sonsuz geriye gidi\u015f veya tesad\xfcf bu a\xe7\u0131klamay\u0131 vermez. Nihai a\xe7\u0131klama, varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 kendinden olan zorunlu bir varl\u0131\u011fa (Allah\u2019a) ula\u015f\u0131r.",B.aSp,"orta-y\xfcksek",B.aVT,B.aBW)
B.aWN=s(["ahlak","objektif"],t.s)
B.aNz=s(["CRAIG-REASONABLE","SEP-AHLAK"],t.s)
B.avu=new A.e("William Lane Craig, Reasonable Faith, 3rd ed.; Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy: Moral Arguments for God's Existence",u.SX,"Bu kart, insan\u0131n iyi-k\xf6t\xfc, adalet, sorumluluk ve vicdan tecr\xfcbelerinin yaln\u0131z ki\u015fisel zevk gibi a\xe7\u0131klanamayaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 savunur. \u201cZul\xfcm ger\xe7ekten k\xf6t\xfcd\xfcr\u201d dedi\u011fimizde yaln\u0131z ho\u015flanmama de\u011fil, ba\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 bir hakikat iddias\u0131nda bulunuruz. Bu ba\u011flay\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131n kayna\u011f\u0131, insan \xfcst\xfc bir ahlaki zemin arat\u0131r. Teist a\xe7\u0131klamada objektif ahlak, mutlak iyi ve adil olan Allah\u2019\u0131n iradesi ve hikmetiyle temellenir. Bu nedenle \u201cObjektif Ahlak\u0131n Temeli\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Zul\xfcm ger\xe7ekten k\xf6t\xfcd\xfcr, sadece subjektif de\u011fildir. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.ad_=new A.b("DELIL-0234","F\u0131trat, Ahlak ve \u0130nsan Delilleri","Objektif Ahlak","Objektif Ahlak\u0131n Temeli","Zul\xfcm ger\xe7ekten k\xf6t\xfcd\xfcr, sadece subjektif de\u011fildir.","\u0130nsanlar zulm\xfcn ger\xe7ekten yanl\u0131\u015f oldu\u011funa inan\u0131r. Bu inan\xe7 k\xfclt\xfcrler aras\u0131 ortakt\u0131r. E\u011fer Tanr\u0131 yoksa objektif ahlak standartlar\u0131 var olamaz, sadece tercih kal\u0131r. Objektif ahlak\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131, ahlaki yasalar\u0131 koyan a\u015fk\u0131n bir Kaynak gerektirir.",B.aWN,"orta-y\xfcksek",B.aNz,B.avu)
B.b2h=s(["mant\u0131k","transendental"],t.s)
B.aKG=s(["BAHNSEN","PLANTINGA"],t.s)
B.aqF=new A.e("Greg Bahnsen \u2013 Transcendental Argument for God; Alvin Plantinga \u2013 modal ontolojik arg\xfcman ve teistik epistemoloji",u.kx,"Bu delil, g\xf6r\xfcnen olgunun yaln\u0131z y\xfczeysel a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131yla yetinmeyip onun nihai anlam\u0131n\u0131 ve temelini sorar. Karttaki veri, tek ba\u015f\u0131na matematiksel bir zorunlu ispat gibi de\u011fil; Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 daha makul k\u0131lan bir i\u015faret olarak okunmal\u0131d\u0131r. Farkl\u0131 deliller bir araya geldi\u011finde k\xfcm\xfclatif bir tablo olu\u015fturur: evren, hayat, ak\u0131l, ahlak ve f\u0131trat ayn\u0131 y\xf6ne bakmaya ba\u015flar. Teist yorumda bu b\xfct\xfcnl\xfck, varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n arkas\u0131nda ilim, irade, kudret ve hikmet sahibi Allah\u2019\u0131n bulundu\u011funu g\xf6sterir. Bu nedenle \u201cAk\u0131l ve Mant\u0131\u011f\u0131n Temeli\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Mant\u0131k yasalar\u0131 maddi evrenden daha temel midir? Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.ajk=new A.b("DELIL-0235","Felsefi ve Kel\xe2m\xee Deliller","Transendental Arg\xfcmanlar","Ak\u0131l ve Mant\u0131\u011f\u0131n Temeli","Mant\u0131k yasalar\u0131 maddi evrenden daha temel midir?","Mant\u0131k yasalar\u0131 (\xe7eli\u015fmezlik, yeter sebep vb.) fiziksel nesneler de\u011fildir ama t\xfcm d\xfc\u015f\xfcnce ve bilimin temelidir. Materyalist bir evrende bu yasalar\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve g\xfcvenilirli\u011fi a\xe7\u0131klanamaz. Bu yasalar ancak ak\u0131ll\u0131 ve mant\u0131kl\u0131 bir zihnin \xfcr\xfcn\xfc olan bir evrende anlam kazan\u0131r.",B.b2h,"orta",B.aKG,B.aqF)
