B.auE=new A.e(u.O,u.K,"Bu kart, canl\u0131 sistemlerdeki bilgi, i\u015flev, koordinasyon ve ama\xe7l\u0131 g\xf6r\xfcnen d\xfczeni merkeze al\u0131r. Biyoloji s\xfcre\xe7leri a\xe7\u0131klasa da, bilgi ta\u015f\u0131yan ve \xe7ok par\xe7al\u0131 i\u015flevsel sistemlerin ortaya \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 h\xe2l\xe2 g\xfc\xe7l\xfc felsefi sorular do\u011furur. Canl\u0131l\u0131kta par\xe7alar yaln\u0131z yan yana durmaz; b\xfct\xfcn\xfcn devam\u0131 i\xe7in g\xf6revli ve zamana ba\u011fl\u0131 \u015fekilde i\u015fler. Teist yorum, bu i\u015flevsel b\xfct\xfcnl\xfc\u011f\xfc k\xf6r tesad\xfcften ziyade ilim ve hikmetle kurulan hayat d\xfczeni olarak yorumlar. Bu nedenle \u201cBiyolojik Delil: Melanin Korumas\u0131\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Melanin \u0131\u015f\u0131kla ya\u015fam aras\u0131ndaki dengeyi kuran koruyucu pigmenttir. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
