B.adu=new A.b("DELIL-0674","Zihin ve Bilin\xe7 Delilleri","Bilin\xe7 ve rasyonalite","Zihin Delili: Mant\u0131ksal \xc7\u0131kar\u0131m\u0131n Normatifli\u011fi","\u0130yi ak\u0131l y\xfcr\xfctme yaln\u0131z fiziksel neden de\u011fil, do\u011fru \xe7\u0131kar\u0131m kural\u0131 ister.","\u0130yi ak\u0131l y\xfcr\xfctme yaln\u0131z fiziksel neden de\u011fil, do\u011fru \xe7\u0131kar\u0131m kural\u0131 ister. Bu \xf6rnek, bilinci yaln\u0131z beyin s\xfcre\xe7lerinin \xf6l\xe7\xfclebilir taraf\u0131na indirgemeden, \xf6znel deneyim, anlam, do\u011fruluk ve normatif ak\u0131l boyutuyla ele al\u0131r. Teist yorumda zihin, nihai ger\xe7ekli\u011fin k\xf6r madde de\u011fil ilim ve irade sahibi bir kaynakla ili\u015fkili oldu\u011funa i\u015faret eder.",B.aHl,"orta-y\xfcksek",B.L,B.ay1)
