B.ayz=new A.e(u.oZ,u.H,"Bu delil, insan\u0131n yaln\u0131zca fiziksel par\xe7ac\u0131klardan ibaret g\xf6r\xfcnmeyen \xf6znel tecr\xfcbesine odaklan\u0131r. Ac\u0131 hissetmek, renk g\xf6rmek, benlik ya\u015famak ve hakikat aramak \xfc\xe7\xfcnc\xfc \u015fah\u0131s \xf6l\xe7\xfcmlerine tam olarak indirgenmekte zorlan\u0131r. Bilincin varl\u0131\u011f\u0131, evrende yaln\u0131z madde de\u011fil anlam, \xf6zne ve i\xe7 tecr\xfcbe bulundu\u011funu g\xf6sterir. Teist yorumda bilin\xe7, ilim ve irade sahibi Allah\u2019\u0131n insanda yaratt\u0131\u011f\u0131 \xf6zel bir ayna olarak anla\u015f\u0131l\u0131r. Bu nedenle \u201cZihin Delili: Bilincin Evrimsel Maliyeti\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: \xd6znel deneyimin biyolojik maliyeti varken ni\xe7in ortaya \xe7\u0131kt\u0131\u011f\u0131 sorulabilir. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
