B.aA3=new A.e(u.r,u.F,"Bu kart, insan\u0131n iyi-k\xf6t\xfc, adalet, sorumluluk ve vicdan tecr\xfcbelerinin yaln\u0131z ki\u015fisel zevk gibi a\xe7\u0131klanamayaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 savunur. \u201cZul\xfcm ger\xe7ekten k\xf6t\xfcd\xfcr\u201d dedi\u011fimizde yaln\u0131z ho\u015flanmama de\u011fil, ba\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 bir hakikat iddias\u0131nda bulunuruz. Bu ba\u011flay\u0131c\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131n kayna\u011f\u0131, insan \xfcst\xfc bir ahlaki zemin arat\u0131r. Teist a\xe7\u0131klamada objektif ahlak, mutlak iyi ve adil olan Allah\u2019\u0131n iradesi ve hikmetiyle temellenir. Bu nedenle \u201cDe\u011fer Delili: Masumun Dokunulmazl\u0131\u011f\u0131\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Masum bir cana zulmetmenin ger\xe7ekten yanl\u0131\u015f oldu\u011fu sezgisi yayg\u0131nd\u0131r. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
