B.av7=new A.e("Richard Swinburne, The Existence of God, 2nd ed., Oxford/Clarendon, 2004","Kaynak zemini: Richard Swinburne, The Existence of God, 2nd ed., Oxford/Clarendon, 2004 i\xe7inde ge\xe7en ana fikir, bu kartta uygulama diline uygun bi\xe7imde \xf6zetlenmi\u015ftir.","Bu delil, g\xf6r\xfcnen olgunun yaln\u0131z y\xfczeysel a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131yla yetinmeyip onun nihai anlam\u0131n\u0131 ve temelini sorar. Karttaki veri, tek ba\u015f\u0131na matematiksel bir zorunlu ispat gibi de\u011fil; Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 daha makul k\u0131lan bir i\u015faret olarak okunmal\u0131d\u0131r. Farkl\u0131 deliller bir araya geldi\u011finde k\xfcm\xfclatif bir tablo olu\u015fturur: evren, hayat, ak\u0131l, ahlak ve f\u0131trat ayn\u0131 y\xf6ne bakmaya ba\u015flar. Teist yorumda bu b\xfct\xfcnl\xfck, varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n arkas\u0131nda ilim, irade, kudret ve hikmet sahibi Allah\u2019\u0131n bulundu\u011funu g\xf6sterir. Bu nedenle \u201cSwinburne K\xfcm\xfclatif Etki: Birlik Boyutu\u201d tek ba\u015f\u0131na kapal\u0131 bir slogan de\u011fil, bir a\xe7\u0131klama aray\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Kart\u0131n k\u0131sa iddias\u0131 \u015fudur: Birlik boyutu, Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine k\xfcm\xfclatif delil alan\u0131na yeni bir a\xe7\u0131 ekler. Bu iddia do\u011frudan g\xf6zlenen olgu ile nihai metafizik a\xe7\u0131klama aras\u0131ndaki ba\u011f\u0131 kurar. Allah\u2019\u0131n varl\u0131\u011f\u0131 lehine de\u011feri, bu olgunun tesad\xfcf, k\xf6r zorunluluk veya a\xe7\u0131klamas\u0131z kabul ile b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eksik kalmas\u0131d\u0131r.")
B.afg=new A.b("DELIL-0995","Felsefi ve Kel\xe2m\xee Deliller","K\xfcm\xfclatif arg\xfcman","Swinburne K\xfcm\xfclatif Etki: Birlik Boyutu",u.ss,"Bu kart, Swinburne K\xfcm\xfclatif Etki \xe7izgisinde \u201cbirlik\u201d kavram\u0131n\u0131 merkeze al\u0131r. Tek ba\u015f\u0131na zorlay\u0131c\u0131 matematik ispat iddias\u0131 ta\u015f\u0131maz; fakat varl\u0131k, d\xfczen, bilin\xe7, de\u011fer ve anlam alanlar\u0131n\u0131 birlikte okuyan k\xfcm\xfclatif dosyada ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z bir destek noktas\u0131 olarak kullan\u0131labilir.",B.aPB,"orta",B.aW5,B.av7)
